{"w":2400,"h":3390,"lines":[{"t":"@MirsIELTS","y":0.003035192361375505,"w":0.31377764383951823,"c":1,"x":-0.0010793372140878905,"h":0.043553175124446897},{"w":0.12114990234375,"h":0.014534883302221635,"c":1,"t":"Audioscripts","x":0.086242297173791588,"y":0.045058139730525859},{"x":0.086242299478452508,"w":0.043121150334676103,"h":0.0087209302063888661,"y":0.093023255805235738,"c":1,"t":"JOHN:"},{"t":"SALLY:","x":0.086242299603869935,"y":0.12354651152517426,"w":0.047227926254272454,"h":0.010174418761666915,"c":1},{"h":0.011925419945280846,"x":0.084113343915520888,"c":1,"w":0.045325673421223955,"y":0.16990938301593905,"t":"JOHN:"},{"x":0.084188911639404965,"w":0.051334702173868804,"c":1,"h":0.011627907316944963,"t":"SALLY:","y":0.20058139515230977},{"y":0.26259346395224947,"t":"JOHN:","w":0.045594094594319665,"x":0.083979133322400132,"c":1,"h":0.011150281337861778},{"t":"SALLY:","x":0.084165416222447595,"y":0.29354733045254466,"w":0.049328304926554364,"h":0.010289059979374016,"c":1},{"t":"JOHN:","h":0.0088077162571009726,"c":1,"y":0.3095496302219376,"w":0.045207821528116865,"x":0.084172269831340851},{"w":0.62848007202148426,"h":0.017292013702842723,"c":1,"t":"I would imagine they get a sense of freedom that might not be a normal part of","y":0.09043447266024629,"x":0.18062062265129991},{"c":1,"x":0.18266818313655647,"h":0.016918001765698465,"y":0.121674037321302,"w":0.61002237955729166,"t":"That's right. And very often the children discover that they can do things they"},{"y":0.13805309749862682,"c":1,"t":"didn't know they could do, and they develop new skills. This gives them greater","h":0.016016669821950158,"w":0.63039016723632812,"x":0.18275152815353901},{"h":0.014049198071865221,"w":0.12783194224039715,"c":1,"t":"self-confidence.","y":0.15175044571861152,"x":0.18458947664033284},{"x":0.18069814698592704,"h":0.014581189113380688,"y":0.16860465136845593,"c":1,"w":0.64887064615885415,"t":"It sounds great. So, what about the practical side of it? How much does it cost for"},{"h":0.018956518032557934,"x":0.18261687581041702,"y":0.18168635760639473,"c":1,"w":0.55882492065429679,"t":"a full-day visit? We would expect to bring between 30 and 40 children."},{"w":0.60790924072265629,"t":"If there are over 30, it costs £4.95 for each child who attends on the day. We","x":0.18268832531972454,"y":0.19910233540090927,"h":0.015701682166715636,"c":1},{"y":0.21504424788402932,"h":0.014749262536873142,"c":1,"t":"invoice you afterwards, so you don't pay for children who can't come because of","x":0.18069814664267067,"w":0.64065709431966145},{"y":0.22969929352268637,"t":"sickness, for example. There's no charge for leaders and other adults - as many","x":0.18268451998604177,"h":0.017425771730136042,"c":1,"w":0.63874486287434895},{"c":1,"h":0.011627907316944963,"x":0.18480492709084473,"w":0.16632443745930992,"y":0.24709302306148873,"t":"as you want to bring."},{"h":0.014534883302221635,"c":1,"w":0.62012318929036458,"t":"That sounds very fair. Well, thanks for all the information. I'll need to discuss it","y":0.26162790718340689,"x":0.18275154692375831},{"h":0.014570041532713351,"c":1,"w":0.59958933512369783,"t":"with my colleagues, and I hope to get back to you soon to make a booking.","x":0.18069814547378069,"y":0.27758112104596788},{"c":1,"w":0.39425051371256514,"t":"We'll look forward to hearing from you. Goodbye.","y":0.2920353980942143,"h":0.016224188790560423,"x":0.18069815164396932},{"w":0.20328542073567707,"h":0.014574329409979048,"x":0.18275154001845506,"y":0.30813953508399095,"c":1,"t":"Goodbye, and thank you."},{"w":0.028747431437174509,"c":1,"t":"Q7","h":0.014534883302221524,"x":0.85420944654013964,"y":0.091569767505865984},{"c":1,"y":0.13808139559032317,"x":0.85215605680053874,"t":"Q8","w":0.030800822575887121,"h":0.013081394746943587},{"t":"Q9","x":0.85420944633968288,"w":0.02669404347737625,"h":0.013081394746943587,"y":0.20203488396737124,"c":1},{"t":"Q10","y":0.23160714774793056,"c":1,"h":0.013760443493328278,"x":0.85189980257392794,"w":0.041778526306152308},{"w":0.10279179890950521,"c":1,"x":0.086181102459549658,"t":"PART 2","y":0.35590537833662839,"h":0.016386917699403147},{"w":0.68185063680013014,"t":"It's great to see so many members of the Twinning Association here tonight. Since the","y":0.38438460912297745,"h":0.01561534566513556,"c":1,"x":0.086173001865124763},{"w":0.73751047770182299,"y":0.39671834540261253,"c":1,"t":"twinning link between our two towns, Stanthorpe here in England and Malatte in France, was","h":0.022195322042369514,"x":0.08401530971223195},{"x":0.084188907302398044,"w":0.66529774983723966,"c":1,"t":"established, the relationship between the towns has gone from strength to strength.","y":0.41710914450081726,"h":0.014576901798754704},{"x":0.084124534351153676,"w":0.74343968709309904,"t":"Last month, 25 members of the association from Stanthorpe spent a weekend in Malatte. Our","h":0.016886181676633916,"y":0.43866578751965979,"c":1},{"c":1,"x":0.086183310600142893,"y":0.45453962665660752,"h":0.015028255316360206,"w":0.71674438476562496,"t":"hosts had arranged a great programme. We learned how cheese is produced in the region"},{"x":0.084099164077348409,"c":1,"w":0.73938461303710934,"h":0.017609072997506803,"t":"and had the chance to taste the products. The theme park trip had to be cancelled, but we all","y":0.46965184595749321},{"y":0.48691860485813432,"w":0.64271046956380207,"x":0.084188912956679005,"t":"had a great time on the final boat trip down the river - that was the real highlight.","h":0.01455632156327058,"c":1},{"w":0.68388529459635405,"t":"This is a special year for the Association because it's 25 years since we were founded. In","h":0.015785204907082462,"x":0.084132747583434864,"c":1,"y":0.50869386050324783},{"h":0.018133485282065154,"x":0.084084282518580453,"c":1,"w":0.73325347900390625,"y":0.52320144792454282,"t":"Malatte, they're planning to mark this by building a footbridge in the municipal park. We've been"},{"y":0.54069767462514207,"t":"discussing what to do here and we ve decided to plant a poplar tree in the museum gardens. We","x":0.082135534384758457,"h":0.014534883302221635,"c":1,"w":0.74332646687825532},{"y":0.55516224179146811,"t":"considered buying a garden seat to put there, but the authorities weren't happy with that idea.","h":0.016058688318483227,"w":0.72073923746744795,"x":0.08213551454423007,"c":1},{"h":0.015730566401748858,"w":0.72293334960937494,"y":0.57731462822096635,"c":1,"x":0.084121628362227904,"t":"In terms of fundraising to support our activities, we've done very well. Our pancake evening"},{"h":0.015803121606157156,"x":0.086158008562450539,"y":0.5929528932952437,"w":0.69420410156250001,"t":"was well attended and made record profits. And everyone enjoyed the demonstration of","c":1},{"w":0.70431213378906254,"c":1,"t":"French cookery, which was nearly as successful. Numbers for our film show were limited","x":0.082135513759619597,"y":0.6090116281068928,"h":0.014587191916496711},{"h":0.017986154696934431,"y":0.62251128845949932,"t":"because of the venue so we're looking for somewhere bigger next year.","w":0.56710657755533866,"c":1,"x":0.086057201763989372},{"x":0.082058194729323755,"w":0.74554092407226569,"h":0.017076778130545422,"c":1,"t":"We're looking forward to welcoming our French visitors here next week, and I know that many","y":0.64720648496547284},{"h":0.017809875173202983,"t":"of you here will be hosting individuals or families. The coach from France will arrive at 5 pm","y":0.66259399615540682,"w":0.72705327351888027,"c":1,"x":0.08205865942244675},{"w":0.72914647420247392,"t":"on Friday. Don't try to do too much that first evening as they'll be tired, so have dinner in the","y":0.67748902702448466,"h":0.018576668708373711,"c":1,"x":0.08204441204092007},{"w":0.74144215901692712,"x":0.084096192808843187,"h":0.016269559494513697,"y":0.69352497916470235,"c":1,"t":"house or garden rather than eating out. The weather looks as if it'll be OK so you might like to"},{"h":0.020969305347903977,"x":0.084048636032930141,"t":"plan a barbecue. Then the next morning's market day in town, and that's always a good place","c":1,"y":0.70733984991171184,"w":0.74155843098958341},{"t":"to stroll round.","c":1,"y":0.72529069748278496,"x":0.084188909048171084,"w":0.11704312642415365,"h":0.011627907316944963},{"y":0.74718607330570253,"t":"On Saturday evening, we'll all meet up at the football club, where once again we'll have Toby","c":1,"h":0.018481090286839974,"x":0.082031028077321363,"w":0.71478993733723961},{"y":0.76296634098821037,"t":"Sharp and his band performing English and Scottish country songs. Toby will already be well","w":0.71268091837565106,"c":1,"x":0.082055112572643057,"h":0.017017159701096962},{"w":0.73528223673502602,"h":0.016899484730048209,"t":"known to many of you as last year he organised our special quiz night and presented the prizes.","c":1,"x":0.08409933864169214,"y":0.77855771032750276},{"h":0.016867396261839751,"t":"Now on Sunday, we'll be taking our visitors to Farley House. You may not all be familiar with","c":1,"x":0.084111633599821017,"y":0.82243342685170218,"w":0.72705118815104175},{"h":0.017078204984861789,"w":0.71682037353515626,"t":"it, so here's a map to help you. You can see the car park at the bottom of the map. There's","x":0.082047263166631593,"c":1,"y":0.83748898668661587},{"x":0.082061840617841234,"h":0.016984628435433025,"t":"an excellent farm shop in the grounds where our visitors can buy local produce - it's in the","w":0.71677215576171871,"y":0.85410027570989722,"c":1},{"y":0.86832612569058409,"h":0.018611287930018761,"x":0.082036546807558938,"t":"old stables, which is the first building you come to. They're built round a courtyard, and the","w":0.71683502197265625,"c":1},{"c":1,"x":0.082039935992018698,"h":0.016983646629130877,"y":0.88346943092065233,"t":"shop's in the far corner on the left. There's also a small café on the right as you go in.","w":0.67783610026041674},{"t":"100","w":0.036960986455281564,"h":0.013081394746943587,"c":1,"x":0.08213552310283391,"y":0.91860465142526271},{"x":0.85215605692611174,"w":0.034907598495483416,"t":"Q11","y":0.48982558165269108,"h":0.013081394746943475,"c":1},{"t":"Q12","x":0.85215605698373731,"y":0.54505813979735585,"h":0.013081394746943587,"c":1,"w":0.036960986455281675},{"w":0.03696098327636721,"c":1,"x":0.85215605861848986,"y":0.58139534897463874,"t":"Q13","h":0.013081394746943587},{"h":0.013081394746943587,"c":1,"y":0.68168604677169542,"w":0.039014374415079822,"t":"Q14","x":0.85010266895904119},{"y":0.75145348863216055,"x":0.85010266895904119,"w":0.039014374415079822,"t":"Q15","c":1,"h":0.013081394746943587},{"y":0.8575581397949511,"w":0.039014374415079822,"c":1,"h":0.013081394746943587,"t":"Q16","x":0.85010266895904119},{"c":1,"t":"IELTSXpress.com","x":0.51176470218665204,"y":0.94166666659226195,"w":0.45294118245442705,"h":0.04166666666666663}]}